# Changelog
All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.

The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.0.0/),
and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0.html).

## [Unreleased]

### Added
- **Cloudflare R2 Integration**: Implemented Cloudflare R2 storage for profile images
  - Added `CloudflareR2Properties` configuration class for R2 settings
  - Created `CloudflareR2StorageClient` component for S3-compatible operations
  - Added AWS SDK S3 dependency (v2.21.0) for R2 integration
  - Added comprehensive test suite for R2 storage operations
  - Created `CLOUDFLARE_R2_SETUP.md` documentation for setup and configuration
- Updated `ProfileImageServiceImpl` to use Cloudflare R2 instead of local file storage
- Added automatic image type detection (JPEG, PNG, GIF, WebP)
- Added R2 configuration to `bootstrap.yml` with environment variable support
- Created `AuthKey` enum to represent the authentication keys.
- Created `MapperAppConfig` interface for Mapper configuration.
- Created `SessionController`, `SessionRequest`, and `SessionResponse` classes for the session API operations.
- Created `SessionService` interface and `SessionServiceImpl` class.
- Created `CHANGELOG`.

### Changed
- Migrated profile image storage from local filesystem to Cloudflare R2
- Updated profile image upload to return public CDN URLs
- Refactored `enums` package to `constant` package.
- Refactored `RolMessageKey` to `RoleMessageKey` enum.
- Updated Spring Boot from 3.3.4 to 3.3.5.

### Dependencies
- Added `software.amazon.awssdk:s3:2.21.0` for Cloudflare R2 compatibility

### Configuration
- Added required environment variables:
  - `CLOUDFLARE_R2_ACCOUNT_ID`
  - `CLOUDFLARE_R2_ENDPOINT`
  - `CLOUDFLARE_R2_ACCESS_KEY`
  - `CLOUDFLARE_R2_SECRET_KEY`
  - `CLOUDFLARE_R2_BUCKET_NAME`
  - `CLOUDFLARE_R2_PUBLIC_URL` (optional)

### Documentation
- Added comprehensive R2 setup guide in `CLOUDFLARE_R2_SETUP.md`
- Documented API endpoints, storage structure, and troubleshooting

